{"seq":3,"slug":"color-science","title":"色彩科学","stage":"DONE","category":"photography-video","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 色彩科学 简介\n\n色彩科学（Color Science）是摄影与视频制作的基石之一——它从物理学、生理学和心理学三个维度解释\"我们如何看见颜色\"以及\"如何在技术系统中精确再现颜色\"。从 RGB 加色模型到 CIE 色度图，从 ICC 色彩管理到创意白平衡，色彩科学为摄影师提供了超越\"好看\"直觉的系统性理解。\n\n本 Hub 分四章覆盖色彩科学的核心领域：色彩理论模型、色彩管理系统、白平衡控制、以及调色的理论基础。每一章都从物理/数学原理出发，落脚于摄影实践中的具体应用。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-theory","title":"色彩理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-models","title":"色彩模型：RGB、HSL 与 Lab","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/color-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-wheel-harmony","title":"色轮与色彩和谐","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/color-wheel-harmony"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-color-pipeline","title":"数字成像色彩流水线","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/digital-color-pipeline"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-management","title":"色彩管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-spaces-gamut","title":"色彩空间与色域","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/color-spaces-gamut"},{"seq":2,"slug":"icc-profiles","title":"ICC 配置文件与色彩管理系统","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/icc-profiles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monitor-calibration","title":"显示器校色实践","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/monitor-calibration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"white-balance","title":"白平衡","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-temperature","title":"色温与光源特性","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/white-ba